language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

unit StemProfile.
capability CoherentStemProfile.
functionality CorrelateStemSamples.
functionality MaintainAbsoluteProfile.
functionality FitProfileModel.

BuckingService contains StemProfile.
StemProfile provides CoherentStemProfile.
StemProfile status proposed.
StemProfile cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/Domains/DetailedArchitectureDiscussion.md".
StemProfile owns CorrelateStemSamples.
CorrelateStemSamples realizes CoherentStemProfile.
CorrelateStemSamples specifies "Correlate position and diameter as domain-owned samples with profile identity, sequence and quality; UI must not infer physical correlation.".
StemProfile owns MaintainAbsoluteProfile.
MaintainAbsoluteProfile realizes CoherentStemProfile.
MaintainAbsoluteProfile specifies "Retain absolute history and separate working-root projection, corrections and measurement revision.".
StemProfile owns FitProfileModel.
FitProfileModel realizes CoherentStemProfile.
FitProfileModel specifies "Apply selected pure taper model, gates/fallback and model/input provenance; reject stale fit results.".
